  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 414.05 Permit Application Denial.\n\n(a) If a permit application is denied by the commissioner, he/she shall notify the applicant, in writing, of the reason(s) for the denial.\n\nSource. #5448, eff 8-24-92; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04; ss by #8172, eff 9-21-04; (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading) renumbered by #9544 (formerly Saf-C 413.05); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
